      "role": "user",
      "content": "oh okay, i guess i'll try the water and salt then. i'm just a bit worried because i've also had this pounding headache for the last few hours and i can't seem to get it to go away even when i lie down. would it be okay if i took some ibuprofen to help with the headache and the swelling? i have some in my cabinet right now.",
